<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 3.1 MLN LOSS.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 3.1 MLN LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.06 vs   0.31 profit </p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.06 vs   0.15 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 3.92 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   10.70 vs  16.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net loss		19.57 vs   0.94 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  19.56 vs   0.86 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	11.50 vs   3.17 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   93.93 vs  93.63</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Espebepe</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
